  flywheel_service -->|"初检/二检/只检不修"| judge_engine
  flywheel_service -->|"AI修复/重放校验"| remediator
  flywheel_service -->|"生成/补切评测切片"| slicer
  flywheel_service -->|"四步去重防稀释与缓存"| deduplicator
